        "line_end": 1,
        "exact_text": "I am a PhD student preparing for an academic seminar next week, and I need a polished slide deck that presents a critical review of my research area. Please create a professional academic presentation with at least 12 pages on \"Emergent Abilities and Alignment Techniques in Large Language Models\". It should cover: background and motivation, core concepts including emergent abilities and scaling laws, a comparison table of major alignment methods — RLHF, Constitutional AI, and DPO — with columns for pros, cons, and computational cost, a critical analysis section identifying open problems and limitations of current approaches, your recommended research directions, and a summary with references. The presentation should make a clear argument, not just survey the field. The slides should include rich visual content such as diagrams, charts, and illustrations to enhance understanding and engagement.\n",
